  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C01",
      "text": "距离血月降临，还剩二十四小时。楼下那条狗，把链子绷得笔直，对着西边狂叫。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/speed1p3/EP009-C01.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "39e06dc11146a1ce0339c27026447b784ebd1f9d2956e3b862b150c91f8e22ab",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.932083333333333,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 178,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 0,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C01.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "fa43f2fff7b712f46d96adab6d92d3622eacf818c1f7be1c752c1f731cd34b60",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "sample_count": 284740
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C02",
      "text": "夏凛站在窗边，只留一条缝。新闻在播，多地动物集体躁动，西南方出现红色云层。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/speed1p3/EP009-C02.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "dce84729c14a425129a59f9738bf880f1de1bda322b476a82a6d89e3c1256f06",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.442666666666667,
      "start_frame": 181,
      "end_frame": 375,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C02.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "d2a4ba1066c97bdb97f23c32758dc33631cece87cdcec688122f126a2d1d3579",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "sample_count": 309248
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C03",
      "text": "她说，我在部队见过这种动物异常。是地震前兆，不，比地震更糟。我问，你信我了？她说，我信动物。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/speed1p3/EP009-C03.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "7a90a6f28b11a200e359147125ebc66f4169ed12234001deb2e246c10a3d18d7",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.519458333333334,
      "start_frame": 378,
      "end_frame": 604,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C03.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "c235f955ada9cbc3d8ad9f94028acfa1b3ae047769f712ce51cb8c4eedda6d8e",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.8,
      "sample_count": 360934
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C04",
      "text": "我们最后试了一次院灯。门外台阶和楼梯转角，白光一亮，照得清清楚楚。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/speed1p3/EP009-C04.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "d6a1c05283692fdd58f809d437ce67426e158394d396ca90035814646c016e00",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.247083333333333,
      "start_frame": 607,
      "end_frame": 765,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C04.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "8526eecb9e0da4b4f608cc91cc37b469fa4167c38208c648dec8f4dc0d55d0c7",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "sample_count": 251860
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C05",
      "text": "傍晚，我路过超市，水和盐的货架已经空了。有人抓着最后一箱水，死活不松手。我什么都没买，我已经没什么可买了。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/speed1p3/EP009-C05.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "f6d40e0adf7de1ee6ae3167b8bed9acd939c6babfbd63582696a437448da31b6",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.701083333333333,
      "start_frame": 768,
      "end_frame": 1030,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C05.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "fdd9f67034371a8b065eb770302f507a6651505721fdbdf1020b4cde7deb5e52",
      "source_duration_seconds": 11.3,
      "sample_count": 417652
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C06",
      "text": "我转身去了医院。许知意值夜班，我带来一箱纱布和消毒耗材，附上正规的票据。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/speed1p3/EP009-C06.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "a4b747dc6ccf36b710ac6c9ea365096f0682d399af365665019116b8a63587ee",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.002375,
      "start_frame": 1033,
      "end_frame": 1214,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C06.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "b78be1680d5495a95fd77a5b1d0b3eaff91417cf48a612b1660f6134dabf6446",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "sample_count": 288114
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C07",
      "text": "她问我，到底出什么事了？我把倒计时给她看，又递上一张写着地址的纸卡。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/speed1p3/EP009-C07.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "051ff8be058968fcd939bdcc58d6d805900c788f429c2d4cb0c5237d638f0c4c",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.388333333333334,
      "start_frame": 1217,
      "end_frame": 1379,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C07.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "6800e1277c024088207b3479eb385a3544463ba4eaafa007aa453454864ce724",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "sample_count": 258640
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C08",
      "text": "我说，明天晚上，无论发生什么，来找我。她说，我明天夜班。我说，那你，就从医院逃出来。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/speed1p3/EP009-C08.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "6ba6be0ff8bfd0616d10bdd9871fd56aa825b66a05744c6663c89b6521cf2850",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.5276875,
      "start_frame": 1382,
      "end_frame": 1608,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C08.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "290258dbd074183999051ad49575a6a6dedd5497eb96320e2d76e12ca53068d3",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.8,
      "sample_count": 361329
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C09",
      "text": "她说，你在咒我的医院？我说，不，我在给你留一个位置。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/speed1p3/EP009-C09.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "72e97c902cb85d9d9cc0d85795a6464dcb2ccda42f38db476a6422cb7a96d17f",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 4.478770833333333,
      "start_frame": 1611,
      "end_frame": 1746,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C09.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "6f77ad81f0db3c598306e32e56da84ae283fdb868eed5f53531482fbca0dc08c",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "sample_count": 214981
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C10",
      "text": "她愣了一下，把卡片收进白大褂口袋。我看着那一角露在外面，才转身离开。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/speed1p3/EP009-C10.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "1772f3ba2170f4b35485fc6d0b47c1a9b969c8f6d1ee810036eb11cd8d2b39ce",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.682791666666667,
      "start_frame": 1749,
      "end_frame": 1920,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C10.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "82b524100dcc8c80e02fc1a6ebcc7fb4a31092d84237d28f95d43d72f39513ae",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "sample_count": 272774
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C11",
      "text": "回去的路上，王大富在群里喊，明晚请全小区烧烤，谁怂谁是孙子。配图里，新烤炉旁边的柜子半开着，一排金条，反着光。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/speed1p3/EP009-C11.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "b1abaeea37a2c1ab298ffff6d4d90dcafa24e206d2758b05821410a1e72dbd40",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 9.592145833333333,
      "start_frame": 1923,
      "end_frame": 2211,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C11.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "4c4b2ea1c676bc537753e6219e483a8eac31292d5384929a16d5d49d778a70d8",
      "source_duration_seconds": 12.493469,
      "sample_count": 460423
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C12",
      "text": "我没回。夏凛握着短棍，等在门边，西边的红色，一直没有退。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/speed1p3/EP009-C12.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "a4b0caa6d575d4dd5c454a4c82f40afe0b431e4ebdf1d86b67bac5b841d9e12b",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 4.933291666666666,
      "start_frame": 2214,
      "end_frame": 2362,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C12.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "fa6440b4cc1db8d33106e5d131b1792d9027134446957c1e0f0accccba07c69b",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.4,
      "sample_count": 236798
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C13",
      "text": "我关上外门，把院灯的控制器，放在手边。等最后一串数字，归零。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/speed1p3/EP009-C13.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "d10cf0dc4515f275c77c6c96699388ff3c01fd831816d5ca8edc2bd66264eb1a",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.1128125,
      "start_frame": 2365,
      "end_frame": 2519,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C13.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "34ab8206a5237f6ff60ca742d570afe2e066382ab1ae48ff68abb2f07a435d3d",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.687375,
      "sample_count": 245415
    }
  ],
